DESCRIPTION

XLQP Gen1 UI is an original Roblox user-interface system created by Sirus /
Sentivel and Itsjose4. The project includes its interface design, layout
system, visual styling, interaction patterns, source code, configuration
behavior, documentation, names, branding, and related assets. The authors
reserve control over the integrity, appearance, behavior, and distribution of
the XLQP Gen1 UI. This license is intended to let people inspect, run, and
share an unchanged copy while protecting the project from unauthorized forks,
edited releases, rebranded copies, and derivative UI systems.

